OL,3,GNEWSAFears as Sex Education beauty spot
OL,4,Aput up for sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living near a popular beauty
OL,7,Fspot made famous by Netflix's Sex
OL,8,FEducation have spoken of their fears
OL,9,Fits "magic" could be lost after much of
OL,10,Fit was put up for sale.
OL,12,FA wedding venue, pub, holiday
OL,13,Faccommodation and multiple car parks at
OL,14,FSymonds Yat East, Herefordshire, have
OL,15,Fgone on the market for #6.75m.
OL,17,FThe "once-in-a-generation opportunity"
OL,18,Fis a stones throw away from the
OL,19,Fdistinctive red chalet used as the home
OL,20,Fof Jean and Otis Milburn, played by
OL,21,FGillian Anderson and Asa Butterfield.
